      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 520,
        "height": 200,
        "content": "## Recipes - Timer\n\n**Endpoint:** POST /webhook/recipes-timer\n\n**Actions:**\n- `create`: Create a new timer\n- `list`: List user's timers (active/completed/cancelled/all)\n- `cancel`: Cancel a timer\n\n**Required (create):** user_id, discord_channel_id, label, duration_minutes\n**Required (list):** user_id\n**Required (cancel):** user_id, timer_id\n\n**Note:** duration_minutes must be 1-1440 (24h max)"
      }
    }
